### PASSWORD_SPRAY — 11 failed logins, 11 DIFFERENT emails, one IP.
### Rule gates on COUNT(DISTINCT principal). The accounts need not exist —
### a failed login against an unknown email still publishes AUTH_FAILURE.
###
### NOTE: these ALSO count toward BRUTE_FORCE (both read AUTH_FAILURE),
### so running this section alone will trip both rules. That's correct
